1
00:00:00,581 --> 00:00:04,171
- What does that mean?
- It means if anyone displeases me...

2
00:00:04,335 --> 00:00:06,795
(Leonard:)...I don't help them set up their printer.

3
00:00:08,756 --> 00:00:10,046
(Penny:)You are so funny.

4
00:00:10,257 --> 00:00:13,797
(Leonard:)Good. Remember that
when I take my shirt off.

5
00:00:16,597 --> 00:00:19,477
(Penny:)- This is nice. I'm so glad we did this.
- Me too.

6
00:00:22,186 --> 00:00:25,066
(Leonard:)So, what do you think,
are we gonna get back together?

7
00:00:25,231 --> 00:00:26,771
(Penny:)Whoa, not so fast.

8
00:00:27,358 --> 00:00:28,608
(Leonard:)I'm sorry, what did I say?

9
00:00:28,984 --> 00:00:32,324
(Penny:)Leonard, you know I will always
have feelings for you...

10
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:34,110
(Penny:)- Oh, God.
- What?

11
00:00:34,281 --> 00:00:36,871
You said "always."
You'll always have feelings for me.

12
00:00:37,034 --> 00:00:39,874
- So?
- That sounds like something you'd say...

13
00:00:40,037 --> 00:00:42,417
(Leonard:)...if you didn't want a relationship
with someone.

14
00:00:42,581 --> 00:00:45,751
"This isn't working out,
but I'll always have feelings for you."

15
00:00:45,918 --> 00:00:50,378
"I'm sorry I slept with your best friend,
but I'll always have feelings for you."

16
00:00:50,548 --> 00:00:52,718
"Here's the thing, Lisa,
I'm into dudes now...

17
00:00:52,883 --> 00:00:55,263
(Leonard:)...but I'll always have feelings
for you."

18
00:00:55,844 --> 00:00:58,884
- How would you say it?
- I have feelings for you.

19
00:00:59,098 --> 00:01:01,558
(Penny:)- Same thing.
- No, it's not. "Always" made it worse.

